WEBVTT

00:00:08.820 --> 00:00:11.320
<i>GUNDAM</i>

00:00:08.820 --> 00:00:11.320
<i>MOBILE SUIT</i>

00:00:11.320 --> 00:00:17.870
<i>hoshi ga furishikiru penthouse de
In the penthouse that watches the stars fall...</i>

00:00:17.870 --> 00:00:24.040
<i>sora no ORUGO-RU hitori kiiteta
I listened to Heaven's music box...</i>

00:00:24.540 --> 00:00:30.460
<i>GARASU no RO-PU wo mekakushi de wataru
Walking, blindfolded, across a tight-rope of glass...</i>

00:00:31.300 --> 00:00:37.090
<i>minna sabishii SA-KASU no kodomo sa
Everyone is like, the lonely child of the circus.</i>

00:00:38.850 --> 00:00:45.020
<i>hitori bocchi no kanashimi ni
The rope that creaks with the sadness of isolation...</i>

00:00:45.100 --> 00:00:50.770
<i>kishinda tsuna ga kokoro de yureteru...
...is still locked deep in my heart...</i>

00:00:58.200 --> 00:01:07.830
<i>yasashii me wo shita dareka ni aitai
I wish to meet the one who's eyes glow with warmth!</i>

00:01:14.710 --> 00:01:25.980
<i>sasayaite kureyo soba ni iruyotte Silent Voice
Whisper to me that you'll always be there by my side, Silent Voice.</i>

00:01:36.690 --> 00:01:41.970
I have no idea why Glemy latched on to
that Blue Corps of Taureg descendants.

00:01:41.970 --> 00:01:47.350
But Glemy promised a dying man
that he'd defeat the Gundams!

00:01:47.350 --> 00:01:50.140
And that's gonna cause
us a lot of trouble...

00:01:50.140 --> 00:01:53.190
Since he's not a friend of mine,
who I could ask to knock it off.

00:01:54.480 --> 00:01:58.610
BLUE TEAM

00:01:54.480 --> 00:01:58.610
(Part 2)

00:02:22.980 --> 00:02:26.300
The output's only at 60%, but the
nozzle balance is still unstable!

00:02:26.530 --> 00:02:29.440
Move your arms! It just
needs some fine-tuning.

00:02:31.740 --> 00:02:35.350
- Elo Melloe!
- Do we still need to tweak it?

00:02:39.790 --> 00:02:44.330
The right knee angle isn't quite right,
and the switch connection's broken.

00:02:45.880 --> 00:02:48.160
The voltage was too high,
and it burned out.

00:02:48.160 --> 00:02:49.470
Do you have any spares?

00:02:49.470 --> 00:02:51.510
This was the last one.

00:02:51.510 --> 00:02:54.750
We'll connect it directly.
It might still burn out, but...

00:02:54.750 --> 00:02:55.850
That won't last.

00:02:55.850 --> 00:02:59.080
- Better than losing the knee's flexibility!
- R-right.

00:02:59.080 --> 00:03:02.680
As we're doing this, the Gundam Team
could attack at any moment.

00:03:02.680 --> 00:03:06.050
I think you're being a
little paranoid, Mr. Glemy.

00:03:06.050 --> 00:03:09.890
Gadeb Jasin's forces will
arrive very soon, so...

00:03:09.890 --> 00:03:12.510
Don't take Gundams so lightly, Elo!

00:03:12.510 --> 00:03:14.860
Remember Dido Kaltoha's last moments!

00:03:15.410 --> 00:03:18.320
I do, but...

00:03:30.220 --> 00:03:35.000
I, Glemy Toto, will not forget that
you saved me in the desert.

00:03:35.000 --> 00:03:38.330
I will not fail to
avenge Dido's death.

00:03:38.330 --> 00:03:40.830
Glemy Toto, officer of
the Neo Zeon forces!

00:03:40.830 --> 00:03:44.460
They say the man called
Gadeb Jasin once said:

00:03:45.610 --> 00:03:49.930
"In this conflict, much blood
and many tears will be shed.

00:03:49.930 --> 00:03:53.430
But on this battlefield stained with
our comrades' blood and tears,

00:03:53.430 --> 00:03:56.690
we must grasp freedom
with our own hands."

00:03:57.490 --> 00:03:59.830
Would you die merely for freedom?

00:03:59.830 --> 00:04:04.160
Of course! What else is there?

00:04:04.160 --> 00:04:07.860
Freedom is easy to obtain
if you go into sapce.

00:04:07.860 --> 00:04:12.030
We hoisted the flag of freedom for
our people here in this desert!

00:04:12.030 --> 00:04:14.290
You couldn't do that in space?

00:04:15.010 --> 00:04:17.750
The Tuareg bloodline
begain in the desert.

00:04:17.750 --> 00:04:22.180
Leaving for space would mean our defeat
by the other peoples who stayed on Earth.

00:04:23.310 --> 00:04:26.140
I see you're obsessed,
just like me.

00:04:28.650 --> 00:04:31.180
My obsession is
reviving the Zabi family.

00:04:31.180 --> 00:04:33.770
You might say it's
foolish nonsense, but...

00:04:34.570 --> 00:04:39.150
People always wish to be ruled by
the hand of strong authority.

00:04:39.910 --> 00:04:46.870
The masses will even accept the rule
of a dictator, if it brings peace.

00:04:48.090 --> 00:04:52.120
I believe the Blue Corps will spread the
Tuareg name throughout the Sahara.

00:04:52.630 --> 00:04:54.450
Is that so?

00:04:54.450 --> 00:04:57.250
I swear upon the hands
that held Dido as he died!

00:04:57.890 --> 00:04:59.330
Where to?

00:04:59.330 --> 00:05:01.250
The city, to wait for Gadeb Jasin.

00:05:01.250 --> 00:05:04.520
Elo Melloe, continue maintenance
on the mobile suits here!

00:05:04.520 --> 00:05:07.260
Yes, sir! God be with you!

00:05:13.150 --> 00:05:16.050
How long has it been since
Judau's group last contacted us?

00:05:16.220 --> 00:05:17.930
About an hour.

00:05:17.930 --> 00:05:19.420
What is it?

00:05:19.420 --> 00:05:20.810
Thanks for coming!

00:05:20.810 --> 00:05:23.610
Look at the monitor. That's Ghardaïa.

00:05:24.200 --> 00:05:26.520
From here, you can head
straight in with the Core Top.

00:05:26.520 --> 00:05:29.120
In other words, you want me to
go check up on Judau's group.

00:05:29.120 --> 00:05:32.880
That, too... but mainly, I want you to
bring back Roux Louka's Core Fighter.

00:05:32.880 --> 00:05:34.910
- And Roux, too?
- I don't really care.

00:05:34.910 --> 00:05:36.620
But the Core Fighter
belongs to the AEUG.

00:05:36.620 --> 00:05:38.450
Man, talk about serious!

00:05:38.450 --> 00:05:40.080
So you'll go, then?

00:05:40.080 --> 00:05:41.920
Why did you say you'd do it?!

00:05:41.920 --> 00:05:43.710
What are we gonna say
when Roux finds us?

00:05:43.710 --> 00:05:45.750
She definitely deserted
under enemy fire.

00:05:45.750 --> 00:05:47.920
It's not like anything she
says now is gonna matter!

00:05:47.920 --> 00:05:49.660
I don't think we should go!

00:05:49.660 --> 00:05:51.420
Look, this is the Argama.

00:05:51.420 --> 00:05:52.800
This isn't Shangri-La.

00:05:52.800 --> 00:05:57.380
If the Argama needs that
Core Fighter, I'll go get it.

00:05:57.380 --> 00:06:00.520
After all, this happened because
I ran my mouth a little too much.

00:06:00.520 --> 00:06:03.020
If the problem's my fault,
I oughta do something about it.

00:06:03.240 --> 00:06:04.820
What's up with you?

00:06:05.250 --> 00:06:07.320
You sound like a different guy.

00:06:09.330 --> 00:06:11.070
Beecha, Mondo, you're late!

00:06:11.070 --> 00:06:12.740
Sorry, Mr. Astonaige.

00:06:12.740 --> 00:06:14.210
We're ready to launch you at any time.

00:06:14.210 --> 00:06:15.750
Sure thing!

00:06:17.840 --> 00:06:19.410
Course is clear!

00:06:19.410 --> 00:06:21.000
Go ahead, Core Top!

00:06:21.000 --> 00:06:23.460
- Is that you, Shinta?
- The deck is moving!

00:06:23.460 --> 00:06:24.920
Make sure you do a good job!

00:06:27.270 --> 00:06:29.510
Beecha Oleg, here I go!

00:06:30.520 --> 00:06:32.640
Mondo Agake, Here I go!

00:06:38.110 --> 00:06:39.890
About that "for the Argama" stuff...

00:06:39.890 --> 00:06:40.890
Yeah?

00:06:40.890 --> 00:06:42.770
Don't you want to get
back into space?

00:06:42.770 --> 00:06:44.600
I see! That's true.

00:06:44.600 --> 00:06:46.820
We should carry through
with things we hate, too!

00:07:01.340 --> 00:07:03.200
I'll take your place, Elle.

00:07:03.200 --> 00:07:04.670
Thanks.

00:07:06.890 --> 00:07:10.590
Hey, Iino, do you think we'll really
find Roux just by waiting here?

00:07:12.400 --> 00:07:14.460
Then what should we do?

00:07:14.460 --> 00:07:19.050
Judau's trying so hard to forget about
Leina that his emotions are running wild.

00:07:19.050 --> 00:07:20.930
You mean his intuition
isn't as good as usual?

00:07:20.930 --> 00:07:21.890
Something like that.

00:07:21.890 --> 00:07:26.300
But it's true that his mind and
Ple's are calling out to each other.

00:07:26.300 --> 00:07:31.840
Yeah. Ple understands Judau better than
any of us, and we're his childhood friends.

00:07:31.840 --> 00:07:34.650
She thinks that Roux is
somewhere around here.

00:07:34.650 --> 00:07:36.100
Iino!

00:07:36.100 --> 00:07:37.830
We're gonna go ahead.

00:07:37.830 --> 00:07:40.050
Go? Where?

00:07:40.050 --> 00:07:41.410
To Ghardaïa!

00:07:41.410 --> 00:07:43.130
Roux is somewhere in that city.

00:07:43.130 --> 00:07:44.910
What if she isn't?

00:07:44.910 --> 00:07:47.010
She's there. I'm sure of it!

00:07:52.270 --> 00:07:54.090
What should we do, Elle?

00:07:54.090 --> 00:07:55.720
I guess we have to go.

00:07:55.720 --> 00:07:57.220
Sorry! I'm going!

00:08:11.830 --> 00:08:14.070
You can't fool my eyes!

00:08:15.330 --> 00:08:17.080
Anybody here?

00:08:19.300 --> 00:08:21.110
Nobody's here?

00:08:21.110 --> 00:08:24.330
All these machines are here,
but nobody's with them?!

00:08:24.840 --> 00:08:26.750
You've got to be kidding me!

00:08:41.150 --> 00:08:42.930
The artist's curse...

00:08:42.930 --> 00:08:46.850
is too many romances
and too many dreams.

00:08:46.850 --> 00:08:48.520
Nice to see you again.

00:08:49.660 --> 00:08:51.650
W-What do you want?

00:08:51.650 --> 00:08:53.730
No need to be formal.

00:08:53.730 --> 00:08:54.500
Then...

00:08:54.500 --> 00:08:56.410
Stay seated!

00:08:58.750 --> 00:09:00.530
We are comrades, you know.

00:09:00.530 --> 00:09:01.910
Comrades?

00:09:01.910 --> 00:09:06.510
Two men rejected in love
should be able to drink together.

00:09:06.510 --> 00:09:10.290
So you also have
a thing for Roux Louka.

00:09:12.350 --> 00:09:15.570
Loving someone is an honorable act.

00:09:15.570 --> 00:09:18.390
And I will tolerate no insults about it!

00:09:24.530 --> 00:09:27.900
This feeling... it wasn't Roux!

00:09:27.900 --> 00:09:29.310
What is it, Ple?

00:09:29.310 --> 00:09:31.770
This feeling is... Glemy!

00:09:32.490 --> 00:09:34.200
I'm sure of it!

00:09:34.960 --> 00:09:36.690
Wait a minute, Ple!

00:09:36.690 --> 00:09:41.180
Glemy, it's a sin for to think
of oneself as great.

00:09:41.180 --> 00:09:44.660
Do you speak of yourself, Genet Cocoo?

00:09:45.840 --> 00:09:49.160
Greatness lies in the actions
one takes to become great.

00:09:49.720 --> 00:09:52.660
That kind of self-complacency
is just laughable!

00:09:52.660 --> 00:09:54.800
You're so young... way too young!

00:09:59.810 --> 00:10:01.560
I can't figure it out.

00:10:12.490 --> 00:10:14.150
What's wrong with everyone?

00:10:19.170 --> 00:10:22.240
It looks like the Islamic prayers
have just started.

00:10:29.550 --> 00:10:31.250
It's Glemy!

00:10:33.010 --> 00:10:36.510
Judau Ashta! And Elpeo Ple, too!

00:10:36.510 --> 00:10:38.340
J-Judau!

00:10:38.340 --> 00:10:40.800
The Mindra?! Why is it here?!

00:10:43.730 --> 00:10:46.130
What are you planning to do,
August Guidan?!

00:10:46.130 --> 00:10:48.640
Neither the AEUG nor the Argama
are in this city!

00:11:02.580 --> 00:11:04.740
Oh, lions of the desert!

00:11:04.740 --> 00:11:07.870
Neo Zeon is at our backs!

00:11:08.340 --> 00:11:12.580
Now, with the support of the Zeon forces,
the day of Africa's independence is near!

00:11:12.580 --> 00:11:16.590
Ghardaïa, the city before us,
will be seized as our base!

00:11:25.230 --> 00:11:27.090
Keep hovering and stand by!

00:11:27.090 --> 00:11:28.390
Yes, sir!

00:11:28.820 --> 00:11:32.000
The tribal movement
called the Blue Corps...

00:11:32.000 --> 00:11:34.820
What a useful group
of allies we've found.

00:11:45.790 --> 00:11:48.660
Are they trying to seize
Ghardaïa by force?

00:11:51.090 --> 00:11:52.960
This way!

00:11:53.840 --> 00:11:55.300
What?!

00:11:55.300 --> 00:11:58.040
Gadeb Jasin is trying
to destroy Ghardaïa?!

00:11:58.040 --> 00:11:59.380
Why?!

00:11:59.850 --> 00:12:01.580
Hurry! I'm going out in the Gelgoog!

00:12:21.580 --> 00:12:25.490
Are there any more who've forgotten
our ideals and sold out to the Franks?!

00:12:27.630 --> 00:12:32.670
Burn them! Crush them! Destroy this city
covered by the grime of Frankish hands!

00:12:37.680 --> 00:12:41.250
That's right! Destroy
every house above ground!

00:12:41.250 --> 00:12:45.340
We'll seize only the underground area
and turn it into a Zeon base!

00:12:46.190 --> 00:12:51.770
Of course, if we seize it quickly,
it could very well become MY base.

00:12:56.610 --> 00:12:58.360
Go back!

00:13:02.700 --> 00:13:04.440
What are we fighting for?!

00:13:04.440 --> 00:13:06.820
What's left if we take even
the lives of children?!

00:13:06.820 --> 00:13:08.740
These are Master Gadeb Jasin's orders!

00:13:08.740 --> 00:13:12.840
Are you insane?! A ruined city
can be rebuilt, but people's lives...!

00:13:12.840 --> 00:13:15.790
This is for our war of independence!

00:13:15.790 --> 00:13:18.630
What good is that war without
the people's support?!

00:13:26.770 --> 00:13:27.920
They're fighting each other?

00:13:27.920 --> 00:13:30.180
- Now's our chance, Judau!
- Go!

00:13:35.360 --> 00:13:36.440
Hold it!

00:13:37.320 --> 00:13:39.190
A Neo Zeon uniform?

00:13:39.190 --> 00:13:41.730
Take me to August Guidan
aboard the Mindra!

00:13:41.730 --> 00:13:43.610
I am Glemy Toto!

00:13:43.610 --> 00:13:46.290
Glemy Toto? Who's that?

00:13:46.290 --> 00:13:50.400
What?! Glemy?! Is that truly
what the man said?!

00:13:50.400 --> 00:13:52.370
Yes, definitely.

00:13:52.370 --> 00:13:56.660
What a lucky man... I thought he
would have shriveled up by now.

00:13:56.660 --> 00:13:59.800
I'd better be careful, or I'll be
the one who gets eaten.

00:13:59.800 --> 00:14:01.840
Lower the ship! We're going to land!

00:14:04.720 --> 00:14:06.130
What?

00:14:06.130 --> 00:14:07.670
The Gundams are gone?!

00:14:07.670 --> 00:14:08.680
Why?

00:14:08.680 --> 00:14:11.090
What? What's going on?

00:14:11.090 --> 00:14:12.850
And now of all times...

00:14:14.650 --> 00:14:15.800
It's Roux Louka!

00:14:15.800 --> 00:14:17.060
- Roux?
- She's here!

00:14:26.040 --> 00:14:27.460
Roux!

00:14:27.460 --> 00:14:30.980
What's with that dumbfounded
look on your face?

00:14:30.980 --> 00:14:35.250
You've been here the whole time?
Weren't you inside the city, Roux?

00:14:35.760 --> 00:14:37.700
Why did you leave
the machines unguarded?!

00:14:37.700 --> 00:14:39.450
We were all looking for YOU!

00:14:39.680 --> 00:14:41.040
Why's that?

00:14:41.040 --> 00:14:43.960
'Cause we can't afford to have
the Core Fighter destroyed!

00:14:44.560 --> 00:14:46.960
So the Argama has just
given up on me, huh?

00:14:46.960 --> 00:14:48.920
That's not true! Not true at all!

00:14:48.920 --> 00:14:51.420
Without you, the Argama
just kinda falls apart.

00:14:51.420 --> 00:14:52.960
So we came to bring you back.

00:14:52.960 --> 00:14:58.270
Oh no... I had Roux and Glemy
mixed up all this time?

00:14:58.270 --> 00:15:00.600
Yeah, we risked our
lives to find you, too!

00:15:00.600 --> 00:15:03.410
But Elle, we should thank Roux.

00:15:03.410 --> 00:15:04.730
Why's that?!

00:15:04.730 --> 00:15:09.400
If Roux hadn't hidden the Gundams we left,
the enemy would've found them.

00:15:09.400 --> 00:15:10.870
Really?!

00:15:15.090 --> 00:15:16.650
Uh... sorry, Roux!

00:15:16.650 --> 00:15:20.460
I just didn't want to get killed.
I wasn't trying to save you.

00:15:21.590 --> 00:15:24.200
- Don't you see I was--
- It means our teamwork's good.

00:15:24.200 --> 00:15:27.300
Elle! Roux! We're gonna
drive out the Mindra!

00:15:28.180 --> 00:15:30.440
Aren't there a lot of
enemies out that way?

00:15:30.440 --> 00:15:32.810
Do you want me to just
sit here and watch them?

00:15:32.810 --> 00:15:35.310
You shouldn't meddle in
an ethnic conflict lightly.

00:15:36.190 --> 00:15:38.110
We can't let them turn
Ghardaïa into dust.

00:15:38.110 --> 00:15:40.800
I'll go, too! Where's the Base Jabber?

00:15:40.800 --> 00:15:42.140
You don't need to go!

00:15:42.140 --> 00:15:43.730
I'll go, too!

00:15:45.870 --> 00:15:49.740
Fine, fine, I get it! I'll go
out in the Core Fighter, too.

00:15:51.040 --> 00:15:55.410
Are you all so eager for glory that
you've lost the spirit of independence?

00:16:07.220 --> 00:16:09.830
Where is Gadeb Jasin?!

00:16:15.100 --> 00:16:17.850
Master Glemy, I have come to greet you.

00:16:18.570 --> 00:16:20.380
Such duplicity.

00:16:20.380 --> 00:16:25.190
With the help of the Blue Corps,
I was finally able to reunite with you.

00:16:25.190 --> 00:16:28.220
I don't believe it, August Guidan!

00:16:28.220 --> 00:16:33.530
Do you think it was mere coincidence
that I found you in this desert?

00:16:33.530 --> 00:16:34.940
Fine.

00:16:34.940 --> 00:16:37.840
I want to see Gadeb Jasin. Where is he?

00:16:37.840 --> 00:16:39.250
Gadeb Jasin!

00:16:40.960 --> 00:16:44.410
From the bottom of my heart, I am elated
to see you alive and well.

00:16:44.410 --> 00:16:48.540
Don't force yourself. You look
like a man who's seen a ghost.

00:16:48.540 --> 00:16:51.590
It is merely the strain of holding
back the joy in my heart.

00:16:51.870 --> 00:16:54.390
Your flowery prose doesn't match your face.

00:16:55.480 --> 00:16:57.260
What is it, August Guidan?

00:16:57.610 --> 00:16:59.220
So you're the one named Gadeb Jasin?

00:16:59.220 --> 00:17:00.590
Who the hell are you?

00:17:00.590 --> 00:17:04.690
Mind your tongue. This is
Master Glemy Toto, our staff officer!

00:17:04.690 --> 00:17:07.890
We're in the middle
of a battle, aren't we?

00:17:07.890 --> 00:17:09.640
You know of Dido Kaltoha?

00:17:09.640 --> 00:17:12.150
He's one of our comrades,
and he is late!

00:17:12.700 --> 00:17:14.370
Dido is dead.

00:17:14.370 --> 00:17:15.440
What?!

00:17:15.440 --> 00:17:16.770
He was killed by a Gundam.

00:17:16.770 --> 00:17:18.110
A Gundam?!

00:17:18.110 --> 00:17:20.490
The Gundam Team will be coming soon.

00:17:20.490 --> 00:17:22.750
Then I'll take them down!

00:17:25.010 --> 00:17:28.210
He's nothing more than
the king of a molehill.

00:17:32.270 --> 00:17:35.390
- August! Send out a Dreissen!
- Yes, sir!

00:17:35.390 --> 00:17:39.030
If you're going to strive, then strive
to become the king of the something big.

00:17:39.030 --> 00:17:40.560
Yes, sir.

00:17:53.240 --> 00:17:55.270
You! Why are you interfering?!

00:17:55.270 --> 00:17:56.940
Where is Gadeb Jasin?!

00:17:56.940 --> 00:17:59.070
I'm right here! Who are you?

00:17:59.070 --> 00:18:00.680
I'm Elo Melloe!

00:18:00.680 --> 00:18:03.490
Even if the Blue Corps is
destroying a Frankish city,

00:18:03.490 --> 00:18:05.740
none of us should not become
minions of the Franks!

00:18:05.740 --> 00:18:08.950
So why... why are you allied
with a Frankish warship?!

00:18:08.950 --> 00:18:12.290
What do you know?! You're just a boy,
with no grasp of grand strategy!

00:18:12.290 --> 00:18:17.010
Someone like you has no right
to question my methods!

00:18:17.010 --> 00:18:18.380
Gadeb Jasin!

00:18:18.380 --> 00:18:21.930
You're just being used by the Franks
who call themselves Neo Zeon!

00:18:23.520 --> 00:18:26.350
Those space people don't
understand the desert heart!

00:18:32.580 --> 00:18:34.810
Elo Melloe! This is Glemy Toto!

00:18:34.810 --> 00:18:36.310
Is that you, Glemy?!

00:18:36.310 --> 00:18:39.650
You can argue strategy
with your comrades later!

00:18:39.650 --> 00:18:41.110
Right now, focus on the Gundams!

00:18:41.110 --> 00:18:45.150
Gadeb Jasin! Can you hear me?
Now is the time to avenge Dido's death!

00:18:45.150 --> 00:18:48.080
I shall carry out his will!

00:18:48.080 --> 00:18:50.540
Dido's will?!

00:19:17.950 --> 00:19:21.660
Let's see how good a mobile suit
created for space really is!

00:19:25.500 --> 00:19:27.830
- Judau! Elle is--
- What?!

00:19:29.130 --> 00:19:30.460
You're off guard!

00:19:36.010 --> 00:19:37.590
No you don't!

00:19:42.480 --> 00:19:43.970
- Iino!
- Ple!

00:19:52.910 --> 00:19:54.470
Are you okay, Elle?!

00:19:54.470 --> 00:19:56.480
Never mind me.
Worry about Iino and Ple!

00:20:01.790 --> 00:20:03.990
At this rate, we're all going down!

00:20:04.330 --> 00:20:05.480
The Core Top!

00:20:05.480 --> 00:20:07.240
The Core Base, too?!

00:20:10.840 --> 00:20:13.620
Looks like we have pretty
good timing, Mondo.

00:20:13.620 --> 00:20:15.450
Aren't we a bit late though?

00:20:15.450 --> 00:20:18.080
This is the perfect time for
the stars of the show to arrive!

00:20:18.080 --> 00:20:20.790
Don't you understand?! Iino's down!

00:20:21.180 --> 00:20:23.390
What in the world are they doing?!

00:20:23.390 --> 00:20:24.460
Roux!

00:20:24.460 --> 00:20:26.920
Man, it's nice to see you doing so well!

00:20:26.920 --> 00:20:29.970
Stop spewing crap and dock
to form the Double Zeta!

00:20:29.970 --> 00:20:31.730
- Sorry!
- Here goes!

00:20:55.220 --> 00:20:56.880
Look out, Glemy!

00:21:02.680 --> 00:21:03.710
Elo!

00:21:03.880 --> 00:21:07.140
Dammit, not like this!

00:21:14.990 --> 00:21:16.270
Two more units!

00:21:25.120 --> 00:21:28.490
Mobile suit combat isn't about power...
It's about mobility!

00:21:30.090 --> 00:21:31.910
I've got you!

00:21:43.640 --> 00:21:45.290
Looks like this is it...

00:21:45.290 --> 00:21:47.460
Forgive me, Dido Kaltoha.

00:21:47.460 --> 00:21:50.510
Someday, I will avenge your grievances!

00:21:54.320 --> 00:21:57.680
Screw the Blue Corps! Damn Gadeb Jasin!

00:21:57.680 --> 00:22:01.360
Prepare for anti-air fire!
Pick up the Dreissen as we retreat!

00:22:10.130 --> 00:22:13.370
War is the death of civilization.

00:22:14.630 --> 00:22:19.330
People, with their own hands,
destroy what they have created.

00:22:19.800 --> 00:22:25.130
Do you understand that this
is all in vain, Miss Roux Louka?

00:22:44.540 --> 00:22:50.820
<i>ikuyaku ikuman ikuoku no hoshi yo
Hundreds upon thousands upon millions of stars...</i>

00:22:50.820 --> 00:22:56.950
<i>naze hikaru dake nano ka kataru chikara no shiwase
...why do you just sit there and twinkle? Show me the power that lets me connect!</i>

00:22:56.950 --> 00:23:08.050
<i>Ima nara ore demo furikaerasu ni tobitatsu kokoro
For now, even I've got a mind that wanders without reminiscing past regrets!</i>

00:23:08.940 --> 00:23:13.930
<i>Hoshi no kazu dake inochi wo takuwareba
If lives are really stored in the form of stars...</i>

00:23:14.950 --> 00:23:19.940
<i>ginga no mure no hikari wo kaete misero
...show me how to change the light and move galaxies...</i>

00:23:20.620 --> 00:23:29.650
<i>kono te ga tsukamu inochi no omosa ni naru
The weight of life itself, will be held in my hands!</i>

00:23:29.650 --> 00:23:35.530
<i>mada meinai yo sora no michishirude wa
Space's guidepost is still not within my sights...</i>

00:23:35.530 --> 00:23:41.620
<i>kono te ni saware hikari isenmanen
Let the light of 10 million years touch this hand!</i>

00:23:45.790 --> 00:23:50.570
"Decisive Lake Battle" sounds pretty cool,
but actually it's kinda pathetic.

00:23:50.570 --> 00:23:52.440
I mean, the Argama gets ambushed!

00:23:52.440 --> 00:23:55.740
Ple withers when she
senses Glemy's presence,

00:23:55.740 --> 00:23:58.870
and Roux is still holding a
grudge against Beecha and Mondo.

00:23:58.870 --> 00:24:04.140
To take down August's Dreissen,
I've gotta go out in the Hyaku Shiki!

00:24:04.210 --> 00:24:07.290
Next Time

00:24:04.210 --> 00:24:07.290
ACROSS THE SALT LAKE

00:24:04.540 --> 00:24:09.380
Next time on Gundam ZZ:
"Across the Salt Lake."

00:24:09.380 --> 00:24:11.020
Is the water bitter or just salty?
